<div class="page-header"><div><span class="eyebrow">USEFUL SIGNALS. NO INVENTED SUCCESS STORIES.</span><h1>Understand what moves learning forward.</h1><p>Live enrolment totals, recorded lesson completions and graded assessment scores.</p></div><span class="icon-tile green"><?= icon('chart',25) ?></span></div><div class="toolbar"><form action="<?= e(route_url(route_path())) ?>" class="filter-form" method="get"><select class="select" name="period" aria-label="Reporting period"><?php foreach([7,30,90] as $p): ?><option value="<?= $p ?>" <?= $p===$period?'selected':'' ?>>Last <?= $p ?> days</option><?php endforeach; ?></select><button class="btn btn-secondary"><?= icon('filter',15) ?> Update report</button></form><span class="results-label"><?= $total ?> learning paths</span></div><section class="card table-card"><?php if($rows): ?><div class="table-responsive"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Learning path</th><th>Status</th><th>Total enrolments</th><th>Completed enrolments</th><th>Lessons · <?= $period ?> days</th><th>Quiz average · <?= $period ?> days</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($rows as $p): ?><tr><td><strong><a href="<?= e(route_url('/admin/content/paths/' . ((int)$p['id']) . '/edit')) ?>"><?= e($p['title']) ?></a></strong></td><td><?= badge($p['status']) ?></td><td><?= number($p['enrolled']) ?></td><td><?= number($p['completed']) ?></td><td><?= number($p['lessons']) ?></td><td><?= $p['score']!==null?round($p['score'],1).'%':'No graded attempts' ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div><?php pagination($total); ?><?php else: emptyState('chart','Meaningful data starts with meaningful activity.','Publish a learning path and invite learners. Reports use recorded events, never invented engagement.');endif; ?></section><div class="notice info" style="margin-top:24px"><?= icon('info',19) ?><p>Period filters apply to lesson completion timestamps and submitted, graded quiz attempts in UTC. Enrolment totals are lifetime records. Pending manual reviews are excluded from averages. Active learning time is not claimed.</p></div>
